  Steps to Install Wireshark

1. Open a web browser and visit the official Wireshark website:
   https://www.wireshark.org/download.html

2. Go to the **Windows** download section.

3. Download the appropriate **Windows Installer** for your system.

4. Open the downloaded `.exe` installer from the **Downloads** folder.

5. If Windows asks for administrator permission, click **Yes**.

6. The **Wireshark Setup Wizard** will open. Click **Next**.

7. Accept the license agreement and click **Next**.

8. Keep the default components selected and click **Next**.

9. Select the required shortcut options and click **Next**.

10. Keep the default installation location and click **Next**.

11. Click **Install** to begin the installation.

12. When prompted, allow **Npcap** to be installed. Npcap is required for live packet capture on Windows.

13. Wait for the installation to complete.

14. Click **Finish**.

15. Open **Wireshark** from the Start Menu or desktop shortcut.

16. Check that your available network interfaces, such as **Wi-Fi** or **Ethernet**, are displayed.

17. Select the active network interface to confirm that Wireshark is ready for packet capture.
